N5008 [dcl.fct]/6, [over.match.funcs]/3, [temp.deduct.call]: a templated
explicit object parameter deduced from the object expression, also with a
function parameter pack declared before it.  Non-vacuous: the last assertion
is deliberately wrong and must FAIL.  Before the fix: "found no match for
symbol 'get'", CONVERSION ERROR.  Verified with clang++ 18 and g++ 16 (g++ 13
predates deducing this).
